================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

This firmware links and/or vendors the following, each under its own license:

  Monocypher (main/sl2_monocypher/)          CC0-1.0 or BSD-2-Clause
    Ed25519/SHA-512 + X25519 subset, unmodified from upstream @ 1830c06d.
    https://github.com/LoupVaillant/Monocypher

  esp-homekit-sdk (components/esp-homekit-sdk, submodule)
    Espressif's HomeKit ADK integration. See that repository's LICENSE; the
    Apple HomeKit ADK it builds on carries Apple's own terms.
    https://github.com/espressif/esp-homekit-sdk

  ESP-IDF and Espressif managed components                Apache-2.0
    esp_wifi, esp_http_server, NimBLE, mdns, led_strip, json_parser,
    json_generator, jsmn.

  libsodium                                               ISC
    Pulled in by esp-homekit-sdk for HAP pair-setup/verify.

  mbedTLS                                                 Apache-2.0
